---@class posthog.dashboard_templates.DashboardCustomization
---@field tile_spacing? posthog.dashboard_templates.TileSpacingEnum|string Named tile density preset. * `tight` - tight * `condensed` - condensed * `standard` - standard * `relaxed` - relaxed * `wide` - wide
---@field layout_compaction? posthog.dashboard_templates.LayoutCompactionEnum|string How tiles rearrange after a move or resize. vertical stacks tiles upward, horizontal stacks tiles to the left, and stable preserves positions while moving colliding tiles. * `vertical` - vertical * `horizontal` - horizontal * `stable` - stable
---@field group_display? posthog.dashboard_templates.TileGroupDisplayEnum|string How tile groups show. sections shows each group as a band that opens and closes. tabs shows one group at a time, and tiles outside any group get their own first tab. * `sections` - sections * `tabs` - tabs
---@field groups? posthog.dashboard_templates.DashboardCustomizationGroupsMap Settings for tile groups, keyed by the tiles' group_key. Each group shows as a band of its tiles under a heading that viewers can open and close. Viewers who do not have bands yet see only the group title above its tiles. A write replaces the whole map. Send an empty object or null to remove all group settings.
---@field group_titles? posthog.dashboard_templates.DashboardCustomizationGroupTitlesMap Deprecated: use groups. Titles for tile groups, keyed by group_key. A write replaces all titles and keeps the other group settings. Send an empty object or null to clear titles. Do not send it with groups.

